@page "/"

<PageTitle>About Me | Nean Mae Abenasa</PageTitle>

<div class="about-container fade-in">
    <div class="profile-header">
        <h1 class="neon-text">NEAN MAE ABENASA</h1>
        <h3 class="location-tag">>_ SYS.LOC: Camara, Bateria, Daanbantayan, Cebu</h3>
    </div>

    <div class="terminal-box mt-5">
        <div class="terminal-header">
            <span class="dot red"></span>
            <span class="dot yellow"></span>
            <span class="dot green"></span>
            <span class="title">user_profile.exe</span>
        </div>
        <div class="terminal-body">
            <p><span class="prompt">root@nean-sys:~#</span> ./load_bio.sh</p>
            <p class="sys-msg">Initializing profile data...</p>
            <p class="sys-msg">Extracting location data: Camara, Bateria, Daanbantayan...</p>
            <br>
            <p class="bio-text">
                > Welcome to my digital space. I am Nean Mae Abenasa. 
            </p>
            <p class="bio-text">
                > I am currently pursuing a Bachelor of Science in Information Technology (BSIT) at Cebu Technological University - DB Campus. 
    Passionate about technology, creativity, and innovation, I enjoy exploring different areas of programming, web development, 
    and digital design. I believe that learning never stops, and I continue to improve my skills through experience and personal projects.
            </p>
            <p class="bio-text">
                > Beyond academics, I enjoy listening to music, discovering aesthetic digital designs, and spending time improving my creative mindset. 
    I am someone who values consistency, growth, and determination. My goal is to become a successful IT professional capable of building 
    impactful and modern digital solutions in the future.
            </p>
            <br>
            <p><span class="prompt text-success">STATUS: 200 OK</span> - Data loaded successfully. Awaiting next command.</p>
            <span class="cursor">_</span>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<style>
    .about-container {
        padding: 2rem 0;
        max-width: 900px;
        margin: 0 auto;
    }

    /* Header Styling */
    .profile-header {
        text-align: center;
        margin-bottom: 3rem;
    }

    .neon-text {
        color: #fff;
        font-size: 3rem;
        font-weight: 800;
        letter-spacing: 4px;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        text-shadow: 
            0 0 5px #ff2a9d,
            0 0 10px #ff2a9d,
            0 0 20px #b800ff,
            0 0 40px #b800ff; /* Pink to purple gradient glow */
        margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }

    .location-tag {
        color: #c9a3ff;
        font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace;
        font-size: 1.2rem;
        letter-spacing: 1px;
    }

    /* Terminal Box Styling */
    .terminal-box {
        background-color: #0b0014;
        border: 1px solid #4a0072;
        border-radius: 8px;
        box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(138, 43, 226, 0.15);
        overflow: hidden;
    }

    .terminal-header {
        background-color: #1a0029;
        padding: 10px 15px;
        border-bottom: 1px solid #4a0072;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
    }

    .dot {
        height: 12px;
        width: 12px;
        border-radius: 50%;
        display: inline-block;
        margin-right: 8px;
    }

    .dot.red { background-color: #ff5f56; }
    .dot.yellow { background-color: #ffbd2e; }
    .dot.green { background-color: #27c93f; }

    .terminal-header .title {
        color: #c9a3ff;
        font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace;
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        margin-left: 15px;
    }

    .terminal-body {
        padding: 25px;
        color: #e0e0e0;
        font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace;
        font-size: 1.1rem;
        line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .prompt {
        color: #ff2a9d;
        font-weight: bold;
        margin-right: 10px;
    }

    .sys-msg {
        color: #b800ff;
        font-style: italic;
    }

    .bio-text {
        color: #f2e6ff;
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    .text-success {
        color: #d000ff !important; /* Bright purple for success msg */
    }

    /* Blinking Cursor */
    .cursor {
        display: inline-block;
        width: 10px;
        height: 1.2rem;
        background-color: #ff2a9d;
        animation: blink 1s step-end infinite;
        vertical-align: middle;
    }

    @@keyframes blink {
        0%, 100% { opacity: 1; }
        50% { opacity: 0; }
    }

    /* Simple Fade In Animation */
    .fade-in {
        animation: fadeIn 0.8s ease-in;
    }

    @@keyframes fadeIn {
        from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px); }
        to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
    }
</style>